muew-preset 2
name Clav Funk
category Keys
author MUEW Factory
tags clav funky bright clean
desc Snappy pulse clav with a band pass filter 2 for that plucked-string bite.
osc1Shape 4
osc2Shape 3
osc2Detune 0
osc2Level 0.6
filterCutoff 6000
filterReso 0.5
filterMode 0
amp 0.001 0.6 0.15 0.1
mod 0.001 0.2 0 0.1
lfo1Rate 5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 0 0
warp2 0 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
unison 1 1 0.1 0.1 0.5 0.7
filter2 2 1400 2.5 1
routes 8
route 1 2 2
route 2 15 1
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 0 0.28 0.42 0.35 0.22
reverb 0 0.55 0.45 0.28
eq 1 0 3 2
comp 1 0.5
